Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Transitional measures regarding administrative dispositions, penalty surcharges, or administrative fines)
The amended provisions of Articles 1 through 61 shall also apply to cases where any administrative dispositions, penalty surcharges, or administrative fines are made or imposed after this Decree enters into force for any violation committed before this Decree enters into force.
